  <section>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>White Mountain Craft Cannabis is the first and only recreational (adult-use) cannabis dispensary in Fryeburg, Maine, and in the broader Mount Washington Valley. The operator transitioned from medical to recreational in May 2025, marking a significant expansion of legal cannabis access in the western Maine / New Hampshire border corridor.</p>
    <p>The operator markets itself as "hometown quality meets hometown bliss" — positioning the dispensary as a community-focused operator serving the local Fryeburg market and the significant Mount Washington Valley tourism corridor. The product menu is sourced from "the state's premier cultivators" per the operator's own marketing.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Location and Access</h2>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 285 Main Street, Suite 8, Fryeburg, ME 04037<br>
    <strong>Hours:</strong> Every day 8am-8pm (per operator's site)</p>
    <p>White Mountain Craft Cannabis is on Main Street in downtown Fryeburg, the town's main commercial corridor. The storefront is accessible from Route 302 (Roosevelt Trail) and within easy driving distance of the New Hampshire border.</p>
    <p>As the first and only recreational dispensary in the Mount Washington Valley, White Mountain Craft Cannabis serves a wide geographic area. The Mount Washington Valley is a major New Hampshire tourism region that draws millions of visitors annually — many of whom now have a legal in-state recreational option just across the border in Fryeburg.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>From Medical to Recreational</h2>
    <p>Per the operator's own site and the Yelp listing, White Mountain Craft Cannabis transitioned from medical to adult-use cannabis in May 2025. The transition made the dispensary the first and only recreational dispensary in the Mount Washington Valley.</p>
    <p>Medical patients can still access product at the Fryeburg location alongside adult-use customers. The transition expanded the customer base significantly — from registered Maine medical patients only to all adults 21+ with valid government-issued photo ID.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Service Area</h2>
    <p>White Mountain Craft Cannabis serves the western Maine and southern New Hampshire border corridor:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fryeburg</strong> (in town) — 5 min</li>
      <li><strong>Conway / North Conway, NH</strong> — 20-25 min south (key NH recreational market)</li>
      <li><strong>Bridgton</strong> — 20-25 min east</li>
      <li><strong>Brownfield / Denmark</strong> — 10-15 min</li>
      <li><strong>Lovell / Stow</strong> — 15-20 min</li>
      <li><strong>Cornish / Hiram</strong> — 15-20 min</li>
      <li><strong>Bartlett / Jackson, NH</strong> (White Mountain corridor) — 30-40 min</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For adult-use customers in the Mount Washington Valley, White Mountain Craft Cannabis is the closest legal in-state recreational option. New Hampshire does not have legal adult-use cannabis, so Maine dispensaries along the NH border — particularly in Fryeburg — capture significant cross-border recreational demand.</p>
  </section>

